Package: openapi-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Unified OpenAPI CLI and MCP Server
 OpenAPI CLI is a powerful tool that generates CLI commands dynamically
 from OpenAPI specifications and serves them via MCP protocol.
 .
 Features:
  * Dynamic CLI command generation from OpenAPI specs
  * MCP server integration for tool discovery
  * WASM runtime for sandboxed operation execution
  * OAuth2 and mTLS authentication support
  * Starlark DSL for automation scripts
  * Daemon mode with Unix socket proxy
  * Cross-platform support (Linux, macOS, Windows)
